<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-15T23:02:12.142Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:02:12 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese Armed Forces have captured Al-Khuwai in West Kordofan and are advancing toward Al-Nahud while the Rapid Support Forces continue drone strikes on civilian areas and power stations, plunging cities into darkness. Humanitarian aid is deteriorating, with food assistance cut for 900,000 people and civilians fleeing towns such as Abu Zabad. A former RSF adviser was freed in Chad after 13 months and a former Sudanese information minister was attacked by armed men in Uganda, while a RSF field commander defected to the Sudanese army. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxORHVrVmJvSHRrc0FGaVNUaFBJd2txbFV1bVdqTm9kTERkT1lXb2lxRl80YzNpUndaeDUzb1Y2V1NnU21fV2w3TmR6RkNUbVhuVnBEaFAwQnc5Ymd4VWtDczZ1emE0Y2RyRnVPblFjWXVkLWVzcTN4VFY3S3FKcWNqdDlOLWlIanRYb0c3blVvZEN5eXJWa191V2RZWUEtVTdDLWhCZ1NVQlB1ak9zM3BBTllpQ0s0QW1WbXFxMWZ3QQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOWXVTdmpMaE8xQjVDejhla3FQS3JuR1NjaW1TeGswMGlvVkpwNFRMVTliLWV6TG9zWk1DN1Z0b2NSQUpwYkNfMEJ4dW9jdWJWX0JvbVp6VFI0eHZWYjNDZEJvaXZ0UURXN3lUV216aWJBeHJIelh0WEhEam9QM2cwdXB0c3BzRVhNdVR3dkxMWTMtalR3amVUNE5UMk9mbTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE5FSUE2R1hXN3NDNkk5VW1jQndFdXJ1N0tSTjR0Z0Q1RFA3T0RUVFpJZHFwYm05NnFMamV4UzNuTk9TRkpiRTRBZFVOVVJUdGth?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTFBLNXlJYWYtUnlDY0JtM19Ibkw0Ti1GeW9yZVpPQW9HeDJDNEVKOFhiV2o3Vno4TDRNenZRSTBsLWwzS0Q